WEBVTT

01:49.440 --> 01:54.920
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.020 --> 01:58.020
[Episode 4]

01:58.350 --> 01:59.610
Say something useful.

02:01.020 --> 02:02.120
Miss Song

02:02.120 --> 02:03.580
rarely enters the palace,

02:03.920 --> 02:05.350
and there's no sign that

02:05.350 --> 02:08.410
she pays attention to or inquires about
Your Highness.

02:08.430 --> 02:09.360
What she said today

02:09.360 --> 02:10.470
is probably true.

02:11.680 --> 02:13.120
I don't believe in

02:14.000 --> 02:16.400
these supernatural and irrational things.

02:16.400 --> 02:19.800
Yet a reclusive lady, who rarely steps
outside her chambers,

02:20.000 --> 02:21.680
knows so much about me,

02:22.870 --> 02:25.079
even matters of great importance to me.

02:26.190 --> 02:28.310
Who could she possibly be working for?

02:28.310 --> 02:29.120
Nan Rui,

02:30.030 --> 02:31.000
or His Majesty?

02:34.470 --> 02:36.000
No matter who she works for,

02:36.420 --> 02:37.530
that mouth of hers

02:38.210 --> 02:40.079
is better to be shut.

02:40.360 --> 02:41.590
Your Highness, do you intend to kill her?

02:41.590 --> 02:43.000
But she's Song Yude's daughter.

02:43.000 --> 02:43.800
If she weren't,

02:43.800 --> 02:45.840
I would have made my move
at the Song Residence today.

02:45.840 --> 02:46.870
Well...

02:47.000 --> 02:50.470
So what Your Highness said today about
the alliance with Miss Song...

02:50.470 --> 02:52.270
It was merely a stalling tactic.

02:53.310 --> 02:55.610
Song Yude will leave the capital tomorrow
for official duties.

02:55.610 --> 03:01.760
[Brilliant Heavenly Sun]

02:56.430 --> 02:57.690
While he's out of town,

02:58.520 --> 03:01.320
I need to come up with a foolproof
way for her to die.

03:05.240 --> 03:07.690
[Imperial Prison]

03:29.150 --> 03:29.960
Open the gate.

03:31.630 --> 03:32.430
Guihong!

03:36.150 --> 03:36.960
Guihong.

03:38.630 --> 03:39.430
Guihong.

03:46.430 --> 03:47.240
Guihong.

03:48.360 --> 03:49.150
Come on.

03:53.870 --> 03:54.680
Guihong.

03:55.800 --> 03:57.480
It's gloomy and cold in here.

03:58.079 --> 04:00.540
I'm sure you're not used
to such conditions.

04:03.820 --> 04:04.430
Actually...

04:04.430 --> 04:05.120
It's okay.

04:05.190 --> 04:06.470
Father has issued a decree yesterday,

04:06.470 --> 04:08.400
instructing the Ministry of Justice
to take over your case.

04:08.400 --> 04:09.630
I believe you can get out of here

04:09.630 --> 04:10.840
in no time.

04:10.840 --> 04:11.190
This matter should...

04:11.190 --> 04:12.520
Although we can't trust

04:12.680 --> 04:13.750
Father's words completely,

04:13.750 --> 04:14.430
and when the time comes,

04:14.430 --> 04:16.690
Heng will do everything he can to stop it.

04:17.720 --> 04:18.240
That's...

04:18.240 --> 04:19.269
But don't worry.

04:19.390 --> 04:21.680
I'll definitely try my best

04:21.680 --> 04:23.000
to help you return to the court.

04:23.000 --> 04:24.950
Then we can join forces again

04:24.950 --> 04:26.610
and unleash our mighty power.

04:29.430 --> 04:30.240
Guihong.

04:30.510 --> 04:32.310
Why aren't you saying anything?

04:32.610 --> 04:34.210
You're not drinking either.

04:34.750 --> 04:36.360
Do you not like the wine?

04:36.560 --> 04:37.480
Let me see.

04:37.510 --> 04:37.950
It's not...

04:37.950 --> 04:38.720
Let me check.

04:38.720 --> 04:39.480
Come on.

04:47.180 --> 04:48.690
It's very mellow.

04:49.680 --> 04:50.530
Guihong.

04:50.560 --> 04:51.360
You know what?

04:51.360 --> 04:53.270
This wine has quite some history.

04:53.290 --> 04:55.940
Back then, I saw

04:56.070 --> 04:56.830
at Father's place that...

04:56.830 --> 04:57.690
Your Highness.

04:57.720 --> 05:00.120
Look, you're calling me
"Your Highness" again.

05:00.120 --> 05:01.720
Since when have we been so distant?

05:01.720 --> 05:05.720
-Calling me that is really putting some
distance between us, you know?
-Alright, alright.

05:05.720 --> 05:06.510
Rui.

05:07.950 --> 05:09.360
Now that you've had the wine

05:09.360 --> 05:10.750
and said what you wanted to say,

05:10.750 --> 05:12.610
could you listen to me for a while?

05:17.040 --> 05:19.070
I always feel that the defeat
of Pingrong City

05:19.070 --> 05:20.200
wasn't that simple.

05:21.980 --> 05:24.070
The Qianyu Army had been fighting against
Heyuan for decades

05:24.070 --> 05:25.580
without ever suffering a defeat.

05:25.580 --> 05:27.210
Why is it that this one time,

05:27.310 --> 05:30.110
the military dispatch was intercepted
by Heyuan?

05:31.230 --> 05:32.560
What do you mean?

05:33.920 --> 05:35.450
Before the battle that day,

05:36.159 --> 05:37.360
something very fishy

05:37.570 --> 05:38.620
happened.

05:39.510 --> 05:41.280
[Ten Days Before the Battle of Youcheng]

05:42.000 --> 05:44.780
[The Third Border Fortress, Pingrong City]

05:45.230 --> 05:46.860
[Rong Hua, Deputy General to Chu Guihong]

05:46.000 --> 05:47.000
General, look.

05:46.930 --> 05:48.170
[Lord Qianyu, Chu Li]

05:53.870 --> 05:55.750
It's the people from the
neighboring county.

05:55.750 --> 05:56.560
My Lord.

05:56.580 --> 05:58.780
They are heading towards the city gate.

05:58.880 --> 06:00.190
Should we open the gate?

06:00.190 --> 06:01.000
No.

06:01.390 --> 06:03.190
The Heyuan Army is sinister and cunning.

06:03.190 --> 06:05.270
If there are Heyuan agents mixed in
with the civilians,

06:05.270 --> 06:06.390
and since our supplies
haven't arrived yet,

06:06.390 --> 06:08.390
we might be facing a dire situation.

06:09.120 --> 06:09.920
Rong Hua.

06:10.160 --> 06:11.830
Take some people to investigate.

06:11.830 --> 06:12.600
Yes.

06:12.600 --> 06:13.310
My Lord!

06:13.310 --> 06:14.040
Look!

06:22.720 --> 06:24.070
Listen up, Lord Qianyu!

06:24.600 --> 06:26.510
If you don't open the city gate today,

06:26.510 --> 06:27.510
our Heyuan Army

06:27.560 --> 06:29.630
will slaughter all the people

06:29.630 --> 06:31.120
of Xing City and Ji City!

06:31.630 --> 06:33.120
My Lord! My Lord!

06:33.920 --> 06:35.950
Please save us, My Lord!

06:35.950 --> 06:36.750
Father.

06:38.550 --> 06:39.560
How did the Heyuan Army manage to

06:39.560 --> 06:40.800
advance so swiftly into the
two border cities

06:40.800 --> 06:42.330
and capture the civilians?

06:42.430 --> 06:44.560
Why is it that when I sneaked into
the enemy camp that night,

06:44.560 --> 06:46.159
they were already prepared,

06:46.510 --> 06:49.110
as if everything had been planned
beforehand?

06:49.390 --> 06:50.590
There must be someone

06:50.830 --> 06:52.240
behind this scheme.

06:52.830 --> 06:54.390
Are you suspecting Heng?

06:57.720 --> 06:58.430
But isn't that

06:58.430 --> 07:01.160
just nonsense made up by
a bunch of clueless kids?

07:03.920 --> 07:05.520
During the Pingrong Battle,

07:05.750 --> 07:07.600
the Qianyu Army lost half of its soldiers,

07:07.600 --> 07:08.730
and I lost my father.

07:09.630 --> 07:11.360
The biggest beneficiary of that battle

07:11.360 --> 07:12.590
was Nan Heng.

07:13.270 --> 07:14.270
He was also the one

07:14.270 --> 07:17.040
who eagerly wanted to convict me after
coming back to court.

07:17.040 --> 07:20.160
No wonder Father also suspected that Heng
colluded with the enemy and betrayed us.

07:20.160 --> 07:21.630
But there's no evidence.

07:24.040 --> 07:25.300
If I make it out of here,

07:25.800 --> 07:28.120
I'll definitely find the evidence
of his treason

07:28.120 --> 07:29.520
and bring him to justice.

07:31.240 --> 07:32.120
Guihong.

07:32.270 --> 07:33.270
I think you'd better wait for now.

07:33.270 --> 07:34.560
Once Father releases you,

07:34.560 --> 07:36.360
we can make a long-term plan.

07:39.120 --> 07:40.070
Have you heard?

07:40.070 --> 07:42.040
Lately, the Seventh Prince has taken
a liking to a woman.

07:42.040 --> 07:43.920
He's been sending servants to deliver her
gifts every day.

07:43.920 --> 07:45.440
It's been quite the spectacle.

07:45.440 --> 07:46.720
Which family is that woman from?

07:46.720 --> 07:49.200
But I heard that the God of Death never
shows interest in women.

07:49.200 --> 07:50.120
Who else could it be?

07:50.120 --> 07:51.060
It's the daughter of Song Yude,

07:51.060 --> 07:52.409
Duke of Guangping, Left Vice Minister of
the Imperial Secretariat

07:52.409 --> 07:54.270
and concurrently Minister of War,
who resides

07:54.270 --> 07:55.120
just outside the Shiqiao Gate in the
west of the city,

07:55.120 --> 07:56.070
Song Yimeng.

07:56.090 --> 07:57.400
Is that true?

07:57.480 --> 07:58.870
Of course.

08:06.040 --> 08:07.440
We have to start the story

08:07.700 --> 08:10.070
from that guy.

08:10.950 --> 08:12.030
[Nan Heng]

08:13.430 --> 08:14.240
He

08:14.690 --> 08:15.890
is a villain.

08:15.950 --> 08:16.910
The ghost doll!

08:19.160 --> 08:20.630
That's a ruthless, cold-blooded soul.

08:20.630 --> 08:22.330
He'll resort to any means to
get what he wants,

08:22.330 --> 08:24.070
even if it means

08:24.070 --> 08:25.400
killing his own father.

08:26.140 --> 08:28.640
[Nan Heng]

08:29.240 --> 08:30.040
He

08:30.060 --> 08:31.070
is a good guy.

08:31.430 --> 08:32.490
The handsome doll.

08:33.789 --> 08:34.980
This guy

08:35.360 --> 08:36.419
is a young general,

08:36.730 --> 08:39.330
who will sacrifice everything for love,

08:39.179 --> 08:43.880
[Chu Guihong]

08:39.500 --> 08:41.200
even his own life.

08:43.970 --> 08:45.330
[Nan Heng] [Chu Guihong]

08:45.720 --> 08:47.550
This is the heroine of the story,

08:47.630 --> 08:48.760
the beautiful doll.

08:51.670 --> 08:53.320
She was originally a rich lady.

08:53.320 --> 08:54.600
But due to her background,

08:54.600 --> 08:57.580
she got involved in a
political conspiracy.

08:57.600 --> 09:00.010
The villain, in order to get her treasure,

09:00.200 --> 09:01.320
seduced her step by step,

09:01.320 --> 09:02.710
plotted countless schemes,

09:02.710 --> 09:05.140
and even killed everyone around her.

09:05.200 --> 09:06.000
How miserable.

09:06.000 --> 09:06.880
In the end,

09:06.960 --> 09:08.080
hardly any of her

09:08.080 --> 09:09.550
intact body was left.

09:09.750 --> 09:11.200
Poor thing.

09:14.200 --> 09:15.190
Tell me.

09:15.240 --> 09:16.790
If she had given the treasure
to the villain

09:16.790 --> 09:18.920
from the very beginning,

09:18.970 --> 09:19.840
wouldn't the villain

09:19.840 --> 09:20.510
have spared

09:20.510 --> 09:22.000
everyone around her,

09:22.000 --> 09:23.360
and more importantly, not approached

09:23.360 --> 09:26.750
or harmed this poor doll?

09:27.960 --> 09:28.870
But unfortunately,

09:28.870 --> 09:30.000
unforeseen troubles can come from nowhere.

09:30.000 --> 09:30.910
The treasure is missing.

09:30.910 --> 09:31.960
It just disappeared.

09:31.960 --> 09:33.720
Tell me, what should she do now?

09:33.790 --> 09:35.790
Go tell the villain that the treasure
is missing.

09:35.790 --> 09:36.910
That won't do.

09:36.910 --> 09:38.720
Why do you think a villain is called
a villain?

09:38.720 --> 09:40.840
Because they just kill people
at the slightestdisagreement.

09:40.840 --> 09:41.910
Then tell the good guy.

09:41.910 --> 09:42.720
Since he's a good guy,

09:42.720 --> 09:43.870
surely he can save her.

09:43.870 --> 09:44.670
That won't do, either.

09:44.670 --> 09:46.120
The good guy is being locked up
by the bad guy.

09:46.120 --> 09:46.910
He can't come to see me.

09:46.910 --> 09:48.750
Then fight the villain to the death

09:48.750 --> 09:50.080
and die together with him.

09:50.080 --> 09:50.870
But...

09:51.360 --> 09:52.960
She can't possibly beat him.

09:56.930 --> 09:58.040
Can't she

09:58.200 --> 10:00.660
secretly replace it with another treasure?

10:01.240 --> 10:02.200
That won't do.

10:02.320 --> 10:03.030
You don't understand.

10:03.030 --> 10:04.960
No one has even seen this treasure.

10:05.030 --> 10:06.630
What can she replace it with?

10:12.080 --> 10:13.630
No one has seen it...

10:16.910 --> 10:17.750
That's right.

10:18.720 --> 10:20.720
No one has ever seen this
method of weapon forging.

10:20.720 --> 10:23.520
Doesn't that mean I can just write
whatever I want?

10:24.030 --> 10:26.200
Since the screenwriter couldn't write it,

10:26.200 --> 10:29.660
then I, the actress, have no choice but
to improvise it myself.

10:30.080 --> 10:30.870
Smart.

10:32.060 --> 10:36.270
[Song Residence]

10:44.120 --> 10:46.880
[The Method of Weapon Forging]

10:44.440 --> 10:46.360
If you wish to forge a sword,

10:47.360 --> 10:49.220
one must first castrate oneself.

10:51.480 --> 10:53.270
Isn't that a bit cruel, buddy?

10:54.970 --> 10:55.900
[The Method of Weapon Forging]

10:59.120 --> 11:00.120
Knife, knife.

11:00.240 --> 11:01.360
What kind of knife?

11:01.550 --> 11:02.510
Knife, knife.

11:02.510 --> 11:03.960
A butcher's knife.

11:05.750 --> 11:07.960
Isn't this just pointless babble?

11:11.250 --> 11:13.650
Why hasn't anyone told me

11:14.600 --> 11:16.510
writing a script could be so hard?

11:19.450 --> 11:21.150
I've been writing the whole night.

11:21.150 --> 11:22.670
What kind of nonsense have I written?

11:22.670 --> 11:24.030
Nonsense!

11:28.910 --> 11:29.720
This won't do.

11:31.000 --> 11:32.760
Better to take flight than

11:33.200 --> 11:34.860
to sit here and wait for death.

11:35.540 --> 11:37.210
Before Nan Heng finds out,

11:38.120 --> 11:39.360
I have to go.

11:46.950 --> 11:48.770
[Back Door of the Song residence]

11:48.770 --> 11:57.020
[Song Residence]

12:12.000 --> 12:12.860
Your Highness.

12:13.150 --> 12:14.630
News came from the imperial prison that

12:14.630 --> 12:16.070
Chu Guihong seized a guard's sword,

12:16.070 --> 12:17.200
broke the lock, and escaped.

12:17.200 --> 12:17.960
Our men

12:17.960 --> 12:19.120
pretended to fight with him for a while,

12:19.120 --> 12:20.120
then let him go.

12:22.750 --> 12:23.550
Okay.

12:24.600 --> 12:25.660
Assemble the troops.

12:25.660 --> 12:27.300
[Prisoner]

12:29.070 --> 12:30.390
Prepare to kill.

12:34.750 --> 12:35.880
Who the hell are you?

12:36.720 --> 12:37.200
You... You...

12:37.200 --> 12:39.140
Dragging me into this wilderness,

12:39.160 --> 12:39.860
you...

12:40.390 --> 12:41.200
Yimeng.

12:41.250 --> 12:42.100
Chu Guihong?

12:43.350 --> 12:43.980
You...

12:44.000 --> 12:45.930
You've been released from prison?

12:48.430 --> 12:49.840
What a coincidence.

12:49.970 --> 12:51.430
Perfect timing.

12:52.160 --> 12:53.690
I have something to ask you.

12:54.320 --> 12:55.120
Well...

12:55.550 --> 12:56.360
Well...

12:56.550 --> 12:57.720
The method of weapon forging,

12:57.720 --> 12:58.850
where exactly is it?

13:04.390 --> 13:05.840
You've got to be kidding me.

13:05.840 --> 13:08.240
First the male lead, now the
second male lead?

13:08.240 --> 13:10.040
What kind of cursed life is this?

13:12.240 --> 13:14.050
G-General Chu.

13:14.360 --> 13:16.640
We were once engaged after all.

13:16.840 --> 13:19.110
Can't we talk nicely?

13:20.600 --> 13:22.230
You're not Song Yimeng.

13:23.550 --> 13:26.010
The second male lead is actually
this smart?

13:26.120 --> 13:27.440
The Song Yimeng I know

13:28.030 --> 13:28.910
would never ask about

13:28.910 --> 13:30.370
the secret of the Qianyu Army
right off the bat.

13:30.370 --> 13:31.670
And she definitely wouldn't get involved

13:31.670 --> 13:33.750
with someone as despicable as Nan Heng.

13:33.750 --> 13:34.510
You are the spy he sent

13:34.510 --> 13:36.490
to snoop on the method of weapon forging.

13:36.490 --> 13:37.390
Oh, no.

13:37.390 --> 13:38.450
You must stay calm.

13:38.670 --> 13:39.940
Come on, think fast.

13:40.000 --> 13:42.260
Is there any other token
mentioned in the script?

13:42.260 --> 13:43.640
Think fast.

13:47.080 --> 13:48.090
Chu Guihong.

13:48.830 --> 13:50.510
Are you out of your mind?

13:50.960 --> 13:51.750
You actually don't believe

13:51.750 --> 13:53.270
I'm the real Song Yimeng?

13:54.920 --> 13:55.710
Fine.

13:57.360 --> 13:58.270
Let me ask you.

13:58.910 --> 14:00.330
Didn't I give you a token

14:00.490 --> 14:02.350
before you went off to battle?

14:02.600 --> 14:04.550
A silk pouch embroidered
with kapok flowers.

14:04.550 --> 14:06.080
All the leaves on it

14:06.120 --> 14:07.080
are red,

14:07.080 --> 14:08.080
except for one leaf,

14:08.080 --> 14:09.550
which is purple because

14:09.550 --> 14:11.080
I ran out of thread at the time.

14:11.080 --> 14:12.370
Am I right?

14:14.840 --> 14:15.080
Yimeng.

14:15.080 --> 14:16.610
-Hold on.
-It's really you.

14:16.870 --> 14:18.510
You didn't trust me.

14:19.120 --> 14:20.120
Let me tell you.

14:20.140 --> 14:21.720
The Chu Guihong I know

14:21.790 --> 14:22.790
wouldn't suspect my identity

14:22.790 --> 14:24.080
right off the bat.

14:24.150 --> 14:26.360
Since I've proved that I'm the
real Song Yimeng,

14:26.360 --> 14:27.220
what about you?

14:27.360 --> 14:28.720
How can you prove

14:28.720 --> 14:30.720
you're the real Chu Guihong?

14:37.720 --> 14:38.510
Yimeng.

14:39.030 --> 14:41.290
This is the pouch you mentioned just now.

14:41.400 --> 14:42.640
Ten years ago,

14:43.200 --> 14:44.440
at Huxia Slope outside the city,

14:44.440 --> 14:45.390
you traveled nine miles

14:45.390 --> 14:47.150
and personally gave me this scented pouch.

14:47.150 --> 14:47.960
You said

14:48.080 --> 14:50.000
kapok flowers only bloom in spring.

14:50.000 --> 14:51.200
But whenever I see it,

14:51.200 --> 14:52.860
no matter where I am fighting,

14:53.000 --> 14:54.150
I can think of you

14:55.030 --> 14:56.240
all year round.

14:59.640 --> 15:01.850
What can a scented pouch prove?

15:01.920 --> 15:04.210
What if you stole it from him?

15:04.750 --> 15:06.430
Unless...

15:08.870 --> 15:10.020
Unless

15:10.510 --> 15:11.390
you can tell me

15:11.390 --> 15:12.240
what exactly is explained

15:12.240 --> 15:13.510
in the method of weapon forging.

15:13.510 --> 15:14.960
As long as you can tell me that,

15:14.960 --> 15:15.960
I'll believe you.

15:18.120 --> 15:18.910
Yimeng.

15:20.000 --> 15:21.360
I've been completely open with you.

15:21.360 --> 15:22.670
But this one thing,

15:24.160 --> 15:25.560
I'm afraid I can't share.

15:33.510 --> 15:34.300
Nan Heng.

15:34.630 --> 15:35.080
Nan Heng...

15:35.080 --> 15:36.000
If you have anything to settle,
take it out on me.

15:36.000 --> 15:37.260
Leave Yimeng out of it!

15:37.670 --> 15:38.480
Chu Guihong.

15:39.270 --> 15:40.480
Escaping prison illegally

15:40.480 --> 15:41.630
is already a capital offense.

15:41.630 --> 15:43.240
You can barely protect yourself,

15:43.240 --> 15:45.840
and yet you're trying to protect
someone else?

15:46.630 --> 15:48.520
You escaped prison to see me?

15:48.720 --> 15:49.510
Why?

15:50.430 --> 15:53.230
Because the guards in the
imperial prison said...

15:54.860 --> 15:55.890
It was you.

15:58.150 --> 16:00.010
I can't believe how dumb you are.

16:00.720 --> 16:01.990
It only took a few words to get you

16:01.990 --> 16:03.950
riled up to break out.

16:04.570 --> 16:07.020
I thought you'd be clueless forever.

16:09.000 --> 16:09.980
Chu Guihong.

16:10.120 --> 16:11.250
He must have tricked you to escape prison

16:11.250 --> 16:12.590
so that he could convict you.

16:12.590 --> 16:14.030
Don't fall into his trap.

16:14.120 --> 16:15.940
Miss Song, you're indeed smart.

16:16.320 --> 16:17.630
But escaping prison

16:17.960 --> 16:19.620
is already a capital offense.

16:20.200 --> 16:21.000
Chu Guihong!

16:21.580 --> 16:23.030
You escaped prison illegally,

16:23.030 --> 16:25.240
abducted the daughter of
the Minister of War,

16:25.240 --> 16:26.700
and acted with ill intent.

16:28.440 --> 16:29.240
Execute him!

16:29.240 --> 16:30.110
Run!

17:07.960 --> 17:08.920
Did you see that?

17:08.920 --> 17:10.800
His Highness swooshed over in a blink.

17:10.800 --> 17:11.859
What's going on?

17:11.960 --> 17:12.790
Nan Heng wanted to kill me,

17:12.790 --> 17:14.069
but he changed his mind halfway?

17:14.069 --> 17:14.829
Song Yimeng.

17:15.440 --> 17:17.089
What on earth did you do to me?

17:17.510 --> 17:18.510
It wasn't me. It wasn't me.

17:18.510 --> 17:19.400
I didn't do anything.

17:19.400 --> 17:21.400
I didn't move at all, Your Highness.

17:22.740 --> 17:24.790
This woman is peculiar. If I
don't kill her,

17:24.790 --> 17:26.550
she'll be a big trouble in the future.

17:26.550 --> 17:27.849
I'm dying!

17:28.069 --> 17:29.190
Help!

17:34.880 --> 17:36.050
Help!

17:54.000 --> 17:54.790
Yimeng!

18:00.850 --> 18:02.460
Yimeng, are you alright?

18:13.030 --> 18:13.830
Song Yimeng.

18:15.270 --> 18:16.070
Come here.

18:17.350 --> 18:19.150
The illustrious Seventh Prince

18:19.340 --> 18:21.830
actually went so far as to
ruthlessly kill a woman.

18:21.830 --> 18:22.720
Nan Heng.

18:23.200 --> 18:26.460
Do you really want to go all out
and fight to the death today?

18:28.090 --> 18:29.410
So what if I do?

18:29.880 --> 18:31.270
All of you, stop it!

18:35.880 --> 18:36.640
Your Highness.

18:36.640 --> 18:38.070
Taking Song Yimeng down today amid

18:38.070 --> 18:39.160
all this disorder today seems improbable,

18:39.160 --> 18:40.590
especially with your injuries.

18:40.590 --> 18:41.720
Don't be impulsive.

18:43.790 --> 18:44.510
Guihong!

18:44.640 --> 18:45.440
Guihong.

18:45.440 --> 18:46.200
Guihong.

18:46.720 --> 18:47.580
Your Highness.

18:47.880 --> 18:49.440
Guihong, are you alright?

18:49.510 --> 18:50.750
I rushed here as soon as I received

18:50.750 --> 18:52.000
news about your jailbreak.

18:52.000 --> 18:52.680
I'm okay.

18:53.170 --> 18:54.780
It's just I fell into his trap

18:55.240 --> 18:56.020
and escaped prison first.

18:56.020 --> 18:56.880
Are you hurt?

18:56.910 --> 18:58.440
If he dares to hurt you, I...

19:01.920 --> 19:02.720
Heng.

19:05.290 --> 19:06.910
Even if my cousin, Guihong,
escaped prison,

19:06.910 --> 19:07.720
it should be the business of
the Ministry of Justice

19:07.720 --> 19:09.070
and the Court of Judicial Review.

19:09.070 --> 19:10.400
What are you trying to do here,

19:10.400 --> 19:11.240
bringing so many Xuanjia soldiers

19:11.240 --> 19:11.920
to hunt him down without due process?

19:11.920 --> 19:14.450
Aren't you worried that Father
will find out?

19:14.600 --> 19:16.030
You misunderstood, Rui.

19:16.160 --> 19:17.350
I came here today

19:18.170 --> 19:19.700
at Miss Song's invitation.

19:22.100 --> 19:22.900
Miss Song,

19:23.380 --> 19:24.720
am I right?

19:27.440 --> 19:28.240
I...

19:28.880 --> 19:29.680
You're lying.

19:29.820 --> 19:31.640
It was you who gave the order
to have me ambushed just now

19:31.640 --> 19:34.040
and even tried to kill Yimeng
with an arrow.

19:34.830 --> 19:35.680
Chu Guihong.

19:36.110 --> 19:37.550
You escaped prison illegally

19:37.550 --> 19:40.350
and had private contact with
the Minister's daughter here.

19:40.350 --> 19:42.750
It won't be good for anyone
if this gets out.

19:44.090 --> 19:45.440
Why don't we

19:45.790 --> 19:47.230
just drop it today?

19:47.370 --> 19:48.480
Let's forget

19:48.480 --> 19:49.880
this ever happened.

19:51.160 --> 19:51.960
Miss Song.

19:52.810 --> 19:54.370
The deal between us

19:54.550 --> 19:55.510
is still valid.

19:58.030 --> 19:59.920
It's better to have one more ally
than enemy.

19:59.920 --> 20:01.440
I can actually help you get it.

20:01.440 --> 20:03.200
Miss Song, I'll count on you

20:04.510 --> 20:06.110
to help me more in the future.

20:07.110 --> 20:08.240
The script didn't write about

20:08.240 --> 20:10.980
Chu Guihong's jailbreak.

20:11.000 --> 20:12.400
It seems this is also a change

20:12.400 --> 20:13.620
I brought about by coming here.

20:13.620 --> 20:15.000
If Chu Guihong and I

20:15.030 --> 20:17.550
end up in trouble too soon by accident,

20:17.550 --> 20:20.150
wouldn't that be more trouble
than it's worth?

20:20.550 --> 20:22.410
We can't just let this slide!

20:23.880 --> 20:24.680
Stop it.

20:24.680 --> 20:25.440
Guihong.

20:25.510 --> 20:27.110
The imperial prison is in chaos now,

20:27.110 --> 20:28.200
and the imperial edict to release you

20:28.200 --> 20:29.440
will be issued in no time.

20:29.440 --> 20:30.750
You mustn't act recklessly at
a time like this.

20:30.750 --> 20:31.740
Come back with me.

20:31.740 --> 20:33.700
Your Highnesses, both of you are right.

20:33.700 --> 20:35.160
This was merely a misunderstanding.

20:35.160 --> 20:37.460
Chu Guihong didn't escape prison,

20:37.510 --> 20:38.350
and the Seventh Prince

20:38.350 --> 20:39.440
didn't try to kill me.

20:39.440 --> 20:40.720
This was all just a joke.

20:40.720 --> 20:42.230
Just a joke.

20:42.310 --> 20:43.880
General Chu, you should leave now.

20:43.880 --> 20:44.400
Go.

20:44.400 --> 20:45.000
Yimeng.

20:45.000 --> 20:45.960
Don't worry.

20:46.570 --> 20:47.920
I will be fine.

20:47.950 --> 20:49.160
My father knows I'm here.

20:49.160 --> 20:50.640
His Highness is so smart.

20:50.640 --> 20:51.880
I'm sure he won't let anything
happen to me,

20:51.880 --> 20:52.550
right?

20:52.570 --> 20:53.370
Yimeng.

20:53.400 --> 20:54.070
You...

20:54.070 --> 20:54.840
You...

20:55.000 --> 20:56.240
Heng, listen.

20:56.240 --> 20:57.400
You... Look how seriously injured you are.

20:57.400 --> 20:58.750
Go back now and recuperate.

20:58.750 --> 20:59.390
Let's go, Guihong.

20:59.390 --> 21:00.020
Yimeng.

21:00.130 --> 21:00.680
Yimeng.

21:00.700 --> 21:01.500
Hurry up.

21:01.530 --> 21:02.010
Yimeng!

21:02.070 --> 21:02.600
Let's go.

21:02.610 --> 21:03.610
Hurry up!

21:45.410 --> 21:46.740
What are you looking at?

21:47.920 --> 21:48.720
I...

21:50.610 --> 21:51.270
If you didn't look at me,

21:51.270 --> 21:53.400
how would you know I was looking at you?

21:58.790 --> 22:01.040
If it weren't for certain people
being ruthless,

22:01.040 --> 22:02.210
forming alliances on the surface while

22:02.210 --> 22:03.780
plotting to silence us behind our backs,

22:03.780 --> 22:06.020
you wouldn't have ended up like this.

22:30.130 --> 22:31.690
Your blood!

22:38.090 --> 22:39.420
Now you're scared?

22:40.730 --> 22:41.830
You were pretty bold just now

22:41.830 --> 22:43.430
when you were lying to me, weren't you?

22:43.430 --> 22:45.000
What did I lie to you about,
Your Highness?

22:45.000 --> 22:45.550
I've told you,

22:45.550 --> 22:47.200
your injury has nothing to do with me.

22:47.200 --> 22:49.220
Why won't you trust me?

22:49.640 --> 22:51.180
Don't think I don't know

22:51.590 --> 22:53.650
what you said to Chu Guihong just now.

23:03.060 --> 23:05.540
Don't mind what I told him.

23:05.960 --> 23:08.100
As long as Your Highness cooperates
with me properly,

23:08.100 --> 23:10.640
I'll definitely fulfill all the promises
I made to you.

23:10.640 --> 23:12.550
But if you don't cooperate
with me properly

23:12.550 --> 23:13.960
like just now

23:13.960 --> 23:16.020
and insist on toughing it out with me,

23:16.110 --> 23:17.420
I'll...

23:17.490 --> 23:19.000
What are you doing?

23:22.480 --> 23:23.350
So what if

23:23.370 --> 23:25.000
I'll tough it out with you?

23:28.070 --> 23:29.590
Y-Your Highness, you...

23:29.590 --> 23:31.440
Are you trying to take advantage of me?

23:31.440 --> 23:32.470
Let me tell you.

23:32.510 --> 23:34.000
Everyone saw it just now.

23:34.000 --> 23:35.350
I was last seen with you.

23:35.350 --> 23:36.920
If I don't return safely to the
Song family,

23:36.920 --> 23:38.680
m-my father and...

23:38.830 --> 23:40.550
Chu Guihong won't let you go.

23:42.700 --> 23:44.640
I don't care about them at all.

23:44.660 --> 23:46.190
Besides, don't forget that

23:46.590 --> 23:47.680
I have evidence of Chu Guihong's

23:47.680 --> 23:49.790
jailbreak in my hands.

23:50.930 --> 23:52.180
I advise you

23:53.110 --> 23:54.860
to behave yourself.

23:54.880 --> 23:56.190
Be good.

23:58.440 --> 24:00.170
Your Highness, it's time to go.

24:00.320 --> 24:02.000
Shall we escort Miss Song back
to her residence first?

24:02.000 --> 24:02.960
Sure, please do.

24:02.960 --> 24:04.170
She's not going back home.

24:04.170 --> 24:05.550
She's coming to my residence.

24:05.550 --> 24:06.790
When did I ever say that?

24:06.790 --> 24:07.740
Shut up!

24:13.370 --> 24:14.160
Let's go!

24:39.700 --> 24:41.270
Bye-bye, you.

24:44.220 --> 24:45.850
I-I'll go in myself.

24:45.870 --> 24:47.150
Please don't bother.

24:51.880 --> 24:53.070
[Seventh Prince's Mansion]

24:55.850 --> 24:58.310
Seventh... Prince's... Mansion.

24:58.410 --> 25:01.160
[Seventh Prince's Mansion]

25:01.340 --> 25:02.770
This plaque...

25:02.800 --> 25:03.800
Seriously?

25:06.530 --> 25:07.720
When His Majesty granted

25:07.720 --> 25:08.880
the Seventh Prince this mansion,

25:08.880 --> 25:09.960
this plaque was already here.

25:09.960 --> 25:11.090
What's the problem?

25:11.460 --> 25:12.410
Go in!

25:14.720 --> 25:16.520
Seven Prince's Mansion.

25:16.600 --> 25:19.060
[Imperial Prison]

25:16.780 --> 25:19.710
Chu Guihong, Lieutenant General
of the Qianyu Army,

25:19.830 --> 25:22.830
recently suffered a defeat in battle,
causing much uproar among the ranks.

25:22.830 --> 25:24.720
However, I, mindful of your years of
loyal service to the nation

25:24.720 --> 25:26.120
and your dedicated duty,

25:26.160 --> 25:29.350
hereby pardon you and order your
immediate release to return home.

25:29.350 --> 25:30.110
General!

25:30.480 --> 25:31.680
-General!
-General!

25:32.440 --> 25:33.110
Guihong.

25:33.060 --> 25:34.820
[Imperial Prison]

25:33.750 --> 25:35.000
You're finally released.

25:35.000 --> 25:35.350
Come on.

25:35.350 --> 25:36.070
Don't move.

25:36.480 --> 25:37.270
Here.

25:37.590 --> 25:38.640
Put this on.

25:39.720 --> 25:40.780
Your Highness.

25:41.110 --> 25:42.270
I don't think this kind of
supernatural thing

25:42.270 --> 25:43.470
is necessary.

25:43.880 --> 25:45.280
Don't you talk nonsense.

25:45.790 --> 25:46.720
Pardon us. Pardon us.

25:46.720 --> 25:48.050
Please take no offense.

25:48.310 --> 25:49.000
You have no idea.

25:49.000 --> 25:49.640
This is a protective talisman

25:49.640 --> 25:50.640
specially against petty troublemakers
that I obtained

25:50.640 --> 25:52.510
from the Imperial Astronomical Bureau.

25:52.510 --> 25:53.350
Father

25:53.350 --> 25:54.750
forcibly overruled Chancellor Gao

25:54.750 --> 25:56.830
and had the Secretariat issue a decree
to release you,

25:56.830 --> 25:58.720
so that you could return to the court.

25:58.720 --> 25:59.350
Now that

25:59.350 --> 26:00.480
you've got out of the imperial prison,

26:00.480 --> 26:02.030
you must get rid of the bad luck.

26:02.030 --> 26:03.690
Your good days are yet to come.

26:03.880 --> 26:04.880
Come on. Put it on.

26:05.030 --> 26:05.790
Alright. Alright.

26:05.790 --> 26:06.640
I'll take it.

26:06.830 --> 26:07.480
Okay.

26:08.440 --> 26:09.160
General.

26:09.270 --> 26:10.470
-General.
-General.

26:41.440 --> 26:43.240
How did she do that?

26:43.800 --> 26:45.990
She's used sorcery several times.

26:46.130 --> 26:47.660
She must be up to something.

26:48.120 --> 26:49.850
What exactly is he trying to do?

26:50.050 --> 26:51.270
One moment he wants to cooperate,

26:51.270 --> 26:52.270
the next he wants to kill me,

26:52.270 --> 26:53.780
then he wants to cooperate again.

26:53.780 --> 26:56.440
Could he have a split personality
or something?

27:04.700 --> 27:06.060
Well, Your Highness.

27:06.240 --> 27:07.520
If I'm guilty,

27:07.750 --> 27:09.350
just give me a swift verdict.

27:09.750 --> 27:11.590
Although your eyes can't kill,

27:12.070 --> 27:13.240
you...

27:13.270 --> 27:14.930
The way you keep staring at me,

27:15.180 --> 27:17.530
it's seriously creeping me out.

27:17.750 --> 27:18.550
Don't worry.

27:19.440 --> 27:20.680
I'll definitely give you a swift verdict

27:20.680 --> 27:22.480
within today.

27:23.480 --> 27:25.300
Don't make it today then.

27:25.510 --> 27:26.440
I'm actually

27:26.460 --> 27:27.670
not in such a hurry.

27:30.350 --> 27:31.160
But I am.

27:33.920 --> 27:34.780
Your Highness.

27:35.350 --> 27:36.830
Everything is ready.

27:37.440 --> 27:38.240
Miss Song.

27:38.720 --> 27:39.690
Please.

27:46.830 --> 27:47.680
Nan Heng.

27:49.110 --> 27:50.440
How can you do this to me?

27:51.030 --> 27:52.350
Is this how you do things?

27:52.350 --> 27:53.350
Some ally you are!

27:53.750 --> 27:55.550
R-Release me already!

27:55.550 --> 27:56.620
Do you hear me?

28:05.000 --> 28:06.100
I'm exhausted.

28:06.650 --> 28:07.800
Your Highness.

28:08.070 --> 28:10.070
I've cleared out all the idle people
in the mansion.

28:10.070 --> 28:10.820
Nothing from today

28:10.820 --> 28:12.510
will get out.

28:12.920 --> 28:13.720
Good.

28:16.270 --> 28:17.390
I think

28:17.420 --> 28:18.910
it's the weapon that's the issue.

28:18.910 --> 28:20.720
As long as I don't use a bow,
it should work.

28:20.720 --> 28:21.510
Okay.

28:21.510 --> 28:22.370
How about this?

28:22.980 --> 28:24.420
It's extremely lethal.

28:29.230 --> 28:30.160
Your Highness!

28:30.160 --> 28:31.120
Your Highness, stop!

28:31.120 --> 28:32.600
You're serious?

28:40.150 --> 28:41.190
One shot to death.

28:44.480 --> 28:45.510
One shot to death?

28:51.440 --> 28:53.210
She's just a defenseless woman.

28:53.210 --> 28:54.520
Must we go this far?

28:57.510 --> 28:59.560
So you want to torture her, Your Highness?

28:59.560 --> 29:00.660
Use this.

29:01.070 --> 29:01.920
She'll bleed to death

29:01.920 --> 29:02.920
in seven days.

29:02.960 --> 29:04.240
This is so scary.

29:06.190 --> 29:08.040
She has to suffer for seven days.

29:08.200 --> 29:08.920
If you think it's too long,

29:08.920 --> 29:10.040
what about this?

29:10.640 --> 29:11.440
Three days.

29:11.730 --> 29:12.800
It only takes three days.

29:12.800 --> 29:14.600
Enough. I'll choose for myself.

29:18.440 --> 29:19.750
This is even worse.

29:27.950 --> 29:29.160
This will do.

29:29.560 --> 29:31.050
What is this?

29:31.590 --> 29:33.030
Y-Your Highness.

29:33.200 --> 29:34.550
Let's talk nicely.

29:34.610 --> 29:35.880
Please, calm down.

29:41.200 --> 29:43.110
Good for you, huh, Nan Heng?

29:43.750 --> 29:45.330
A monster in human skin.

29:45.540 --> 29:47.280
So heartless and ruthless.

29:49.440 --> 29:50.590
What should I do?

29:50.650 --> 29:53.270
Am I really going to die here?

29:56.910 --> 29:58.220
Oh my god.

30:11.060 --> 30:12.200
Oh my.

30:12.830 --> 30:14.010
Oh my.

30:14.200 --> 30:16.160
I was almost scared to death.

30:18.460 --> 30:19.510
Your Highness.

30:19.670 --> 30:20.900
Your Highness.

30:21.500 --> 30:23.000
I'm begging you.

30:23.280 --> 30:24.900
Please let me go.

30:25.130 --> 30:27.110
My life is really worthless.

30:28.290 --> 30:29.480
If you keep me alive,

30:29.550 --> 30:31.510
I can still work for you,

30:31.530 --> 30:32.320
right?

30:32.350 --> 30:33.400
Having you here

30:33.750 --> 30:36.180
is the most important thing to me.

30:36.920 --> 30:38.860
What's wrong with him?

30:38.890 --> 30:39.920
Saying cheesy lines

30:39.920 --> 30:42.160
at a time like this?

31:27.750 --> 31:29.950
I didn't expect that even with armor on,

31:30.350 --> 31:31.870
I still failed to dodge it.

31:32.010 --> 31:33.170
Hang in there.

31:41.160 --> 31:42.020
Your Highness.

31:42.370 --> 31:43.990
Why don't you let it slide?

31:44.020 --> 31:45.220
That's not an option.

31:47.460 --> 31:48.700
This Song Yimeng.

31:50.200 --> 31:52.260
Since she can't be killed by weapons,

31:53.500 --> 31:55.590
go find the physician in our residence

31:55.590 --> 31:56.790
and get some poisons.

31:57.680 --> 31:58.480
Yes.

31:59.660 --> 32:00.450
Wait.

32:03.880 --> 32:04.680
Make sure

32:05.030 --> 32:05.830
the poison's

32:07.070 --> 32:07.880
not deadly.

32:10.240 --> 32:11.640
Not deadly?

32:12.510 --> 32:13.310
Got it.

32:35.200 --> 32:36.000
What is this?

32:37.160 --> 32:38.420
Blanched vegetables.

32:38.790 --> 32:40.510
Fine, it's red.

32:41.590 --> 32:42.440
What about this?

32:42.440 --> 32:43.700
Braised chicken feet.

32:44.680 --> 32:45.790
And it's blue?

32:50.030 --> 32:51.230
Well, Your Highness.

32:52.380 --> 32:54.370
Even if you want to poison me,

32:54.450 --> 32:56.750
you should at least put on a
complete show.

32:56.750 --> 32:57.550
This...

32:57.580 --> 32:59.260
With the poison so obvious,

33:00.220 --> 33:02.320
even an idiot wouldn't eat it, okay?

33:05.480 --> 33:06.550
Others may not,

33:06.850 --> 33:08.510
but you must eat it, Miss Song.

33:08.630 --> 33:10.890
You can't leave today if you don't eat it.

33:13.980 --> 33:14.790
Please.

33:27.330 --> 33:30.730
What kind of braised chicken feet
are blue?

33:39.880 --> 33:40.740
Your Highness.

33:40.830 --> 33:42.350
I'm a coward. I'm too scared to die.

33:42.350 --> 33:43.830
I really can't bring myself to eat it.

33:43.830 --> 33:44.440
I...

33:44.560 --> 33:44.950
I...

33:46.120 --> 33:47.230
I'm leaving.

33:48.900 --> 33:50.240
Bro, please let me go.

33:50.240 --> 33:52.480
That color just screams "not tasty!"

33:53.560 --> 33:55.820
Since you don't want to eat it, Miss Song,

33:56.550 --> 33:58.720
I'll feed you myself.

34:00.830 --> 34:01.780
Your Highness.

34:01.830 --> 34:02.830
Why don't we

34:02.830 --> 34:04.070
forget it today?

34:04.090 --> 34:05.030
I really can't bring myself to eat it.

34:05.030 --> 34:05.480
Open your mouth.

34:05.480 --> 34:05.960
I...

34:09.699 --> 34:11.630
Miss Song, you're very beautiful.

34:11.960 --> 34:14.510
If I smash all your teeth

34:14.510 --> 34:15.739
and force you to eat them,

34:15.739 --> 34:17.400
it wouldn't be a pretty sight.

34:19.000 --> 34:19.800
Come on.

34:23.480 --> 34:24.530
Open your mouth.

34:34.659 --> 34:35.810
Forget it.

34:37.190 --> 34:39.110
Since you hate it so much, Miss Song,

34:39.110 --> 34:41.000
I won't force you.

34:44.960 --> 34:46.190
Thank you, Your Highness.

34:46.190 --> 34:47.290
Thank you, Your Highness.

34:47.290 --> 34:48.120
Thank you.

35:07.510 --> 35:08.370
Your Highness!

35:09.250 --> 35:10.960
Physician! Physician!

35:11.320 --> 35:12.580
Come here, Physician!

35:25.190 --> 35:26.070
Your Highness. Your Highness.

35:26.070 --> 35:26.670
Hurry.

35:26.670 --> 35:27.840
Drink the antidote.

35:28.710 --> 35:29.680
Your Highness.

35:29.960 --> 35:31.360
I really think we should let it slide.

35:31.360 --> 35:32.110
If this goes on,

35:32.110 --> 35:33.000
Miss Song might be alright,

35:33.000 --> 35:34.660
but we won't last much longer.

35:35.190 --> 35:36.000
No.

35:36.840 --> 35:38.640
It's not the end of the world yet.

35:39.400 --> 35:40.460
We mustn't give up.

35:41.550 --> 35:42.630
This Song Yimeng.

35:43.840 --> 35:45.500
I definitely won't let her go!

35:53.660 --> 35:56.000
[Ultimate Emptiness, Profound Tranquility]

36:09.760 --> 36:11.840
When will you ever stop?

36:12.000 --> 36:13.000
If you're going to kill me,

36:13.000 --> 36:14.380
just get it over with!

36:14.630 --> 36:15.640
Do you hear me?

36:23.270 --> 36:25.150
Are you really that determined

36:25.760 --> 36:27.320
to kill me?

36:27.840 --> 36:28.630
Miss Song.

36:28.800 --> 36:29.510
Pardon me.

36:29.510 --> 36:30.440
You... Don't...

36:50.480 --> 36:51.590
Oh, no.

36:51.900 --> 36:53.230
Looks like

36:53.480 --> 36:56.330
I'm really going to die here today.

37:11.280 --> 37:12.820
[Ultimate Emptiness, Profound Tranquility]

37:32.530 --> 37:35.840
♪ Through the night's soft whispers ♪

37:36.720 --> 37:41.200
♪ Parting the mist,
gazing into your eyes ♪

37:45.210 --> 37:48.520
♪ Guiding the tides of dreams ♪

37:49.310 --> 37:55.260
♪ Solidifying into the marks of time
and all beings ♪

37:56.720 --> 38:01.490
♪ Seeking refuge amid the drifting ♪

38:02.820 --> 38:07.550
♪ Tracing ripples in the realm of
time's return ♪

38:08.610 --> 38:12.650
♪ Beneath the converging rivers,
silent undercurrents flow ♪

38:13.870 --> 38:19.590
♪ Surging, magnificent ♪

38:51.100 --> 38:51.800
Your Highness!

38:51.800 --> 38:52.530
Your Highness!

38:52.530 --> 38:53.390
Your Highness!

38:53.400 --> 38:54.260
Your Highness!

38:54.400 --> 38:55.190
Your Highness!

38:55.190 --> 38:56.150
Where are you?

38:57.510 --> 38:58.370
Your Highness!

38:59.070 --> 39:00.260
Why it it you?

39:00.320 --> 39:01.580
Where is His Highness?

39:07.070 --> 39:08.280
Give me a hand.

39:21.800 --> 39:23.480
Trying to mess with me?

39:23.690 --> 39:25.420
You've messed up, haven't you?

39:25.450 --> 39:27.780
Let's see if you dare to mess
with me again.

39:34.480 --> 39:35.710
-Take it easy.
-Go.

39:34.670 --> 39:37.090
[Seventh Prince's Mansion]

39:39.920 --> 39:40.980
Stop there.

39:41.840 --> 39:42.760
You've had me tied up

39:42.760 --> 39:44.190
and messed with me all day,

39:44.190 --> 39:46.400
and now you just say it's a wrap
like that?

39:46.400 --> 39:48.000
And they call him a top star?

39:48.110 --> 39:48.920
Bah!

39:49.670 --> 39:50.480
Miss Song.

39:50.760 --> 39:51.760
His Highness said

39:51.880 --> 39:52.760
he wouldn't hold you accountable

39:52.760 --> 39:53.800
for what happened today.

39:53.800 --> 39:55.930
But please keep your mouth shut.

39:56.550 --> 39:58.070
If someone else finds out,

39:58.880 --> 40:00.670
even if you find what His Highness wants,

40:00.670 --> 40:01.960
he won't let you go.

40:02.800 --> 40:04.030
Are you not human?

40:04.230 --> 40:05.610
Don't you know how to count?

40:05.610 --> 40:07.210
Have you ever been to school?

40:13.880 --> 40:14.630
This is...

40:15.170 --> 40:16.720
There are wolves around?

40:18.870 --> 40:20.090
Don't go.

40:21.070 --> 40:21.880
Well,

40:22.150 --> 40:24.010
at least send me a carriage, okay?

40:24.230 --> 40:27.230
[Seventh Prince's Mansion]

40:24.300 --> 40:25.880
It's in the middle of nowhere,

40:25.880 --> 40:27.110
and I'm just a girl.

40:27.520 --> 40:29.150
How am I supposed to get back?

40:33.960 --> 40:34.590
This...

40:35.210 --> 40:36.870
Are you brushing off a beggar?

40:40.280 --> 40:41.840
A scumbag is a scumbag.

40:42.640 --> 40:44.240
Both mean and cheap.

40:46.180 --> 40:54.560
[Seventh Prince's Mansion]

40:52.720 --> 40:53.800
I can't give up the money.
